      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>A failure code for the whole ranging request operation. Indicates that the request failed due to RTT not being available - e.g. Wi-Fi was disabled. Use the WifiRttManager.isAvailable() and WifiRttManager.ACTION_WIFI_RTT_STATE_CHANGED to track RTT availability.</para>
